RasterIX vendoring
==================

Upstream: https://github.com/ToNi3141/RasterIX
Superproject commit: 9269a01c9bd4c3342bfa70ef8e3cdd751c15c6d0
License: GPL-3.0-or-later (verbatim LICENSE included here)
Float submodule: https://github.com/ToNi3141/Float.git @ 060bde1fc3c480f46495b740ddbe2bdf24958491

This directory contains only the byte-identical dependency closure needed by
RasterIX_IF/RasterIXCoreIF: RasterIX core, framebuffer, texture-cache and AXI
helpers; Float arithmetic helpers; and the upstream GPL-3.0 license. The
following upstream material is intentionally excluded: top-level board designs,
RasterIX_EF/RasterIXCoreEF/RasterIX top-level variants, HyperRAM, simulations,
and unrelated third-party IP. ZZ9000-specific integration is exclusively in
rtl/zz9k_rix/.

Local synthesis-safe corrections are documented in `PATCHES.md` and retained
as `patches/0001` through `0004`. `test/rasterix/run.sh` byte-compares every
vendored file against the pinned upstream revision except exactly those four
documented paths.
